With paramla,

you can track current values, percentage break-downs, trends, total and average costs, profit/loss amounts and margins of your entire assets, in any currency and on a single screen simply by recording their quantities and unit costs;

you can monitor current prices and trends of nearly 25 thousand financial assets under Gold | Silver | Commodity, Foreign Currency, Fund, Stock (BİST and US Exchanges) and Digital Currency categories in any currency you pick;

you can add up to 20 portfolios and sync up to 10 devices to share and co-manage your portfolios if you like;

you are never asked to provide or store any personal data (name, surname, e-mail address etc.) so that you can always remain anonymous;

you can set your default language to English or Turkish at any time with a single tap;

no trading or storage of any financial asset, nor any monetary transaction nor any financial advisory or investment consultancy service whatsoever is provided.

Enjoy!

